        rdfs:comment                   "Length, full loom width. Roller and block print in neutral red and brown on natural cotton. Fluted pillar, decorated with elaborate capitals, fruit compositions and leafy scrolls, runs down center. Baskets of friuts and bouquets at either side. Ground brown. A few stains and small holes. Ragged edges. Both selvedges present."@en ;
